{"4704520":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"ShredDead","steam_appid":4704520,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5279660],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world as you know it is over.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dreaded zombie apocalypse has arrived.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are ready to make your last stand and go down in a blaze of glory…<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PROBLEM IS, you’re too good at this asymmetric warfare thing, and this “last stand” is taking forever. At this point, this is not about survival — this is about <strong>FUN<\/strong>. Shoot them, burn them, blow them up, and, if all else fails, <strong>SHRED THE DEAD<\/strong> — with your very own heavy-duty industrial shredder, of course.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/extras\/bac56c54920a65940bd7875603a1eb5f.poster.avif?t=1793273903\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/extras\/bac56c54920a65940bd7875603a1eb5f.webm?t=1793273903\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/extras\/bac56c54920a65940bd7875603a1eb5f.mp4?t=1793273903\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ZOMBIE BLENDER<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get into a flow state of methodically decimating the unending deluge of zombies — or have your grunts do it for you! Or both!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/extras\/d3b7c377003267e8f09ae25cb3c86703.poster.avif?t=1793273903\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/extras\/d3b7c377003267e8f09ae25cb3c86703.webm?t=1793273903\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/extras\/d3b7c377003267e8f09ae25cb3c86703.mp4?t=1793273903\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRANCHING OUT<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you turn more and more zombies into mincemeat, explore the vast skill tree to optimize the killing!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/extras\/7dbd1cc99bbc298cfdf517fb0146c5cd.poster.avif?t=1793273903\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/extras\/7dbd1cc99bbc298cfdf517fb0146c5cd.webm?t=1793273903\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/extras\/7dbd1cc99bbc298cfdf517fb0146c5cd.mp4?t=1793273903\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LOCK AND LOAD<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kit your grunts out with the best toys you can get your hands on — after all, zombies are nice enough to deliver the loot right to your doorstep!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/extras\/95ad50f628e6bf2afd4734cfd8c0f226.poster.avif?t=1793273903\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/extras\/95ad50f628e6bf2afd4734cfd8c0f226.webm?t=1793273903\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/extras\/95ad50f628e6bf2afd4734cfd8c0f226.mp4?t=1793273903\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EMBRACE THE YUCK<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies are known to evolve, but evolution is boring and takes too long. Why not have your mad scientist speed it up a little? With predictably gross results, of course!<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world as you know it is over.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dreaded zombie apocalypse has arrived.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are ready to make your last stand and go down in a blaze of glory…<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PROBLEM IS, you’re too good at this asymmetric warfare thing, and this “last stand” is taking forever. At this point, this is not about survival — this is about <strong>FUN<\/strong>. Shoot them, burn them, blow them up, and, if all else fails, <strong>SHRED THE DEAD<\/strong> — with your very own heavy-duty industrial shredder, of course.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/extras\/bac56c54920a65940bd7875603a1eb5f.poster.avif?t=1793273903\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/extras\/bac56c54920a65940bd7875603a1eb5f.webm?t=1793273903\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/extras\/bac56c54920a65940bd7875603a1eb5f.mp4?t=1793273903\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ZOMBIE BLENDER<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get into a flow state of methodically decimating the unending deluge of zombies — or have your grunts do it for you! Or both!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/extras\/d3b7c377003267e8f09ae25cb3c86703.poster.avif?t=1793273903\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/extras\/d3b7c377003267e8f09ae25cb3c86703.webm?t=1793273903\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/extras\/d3b7c377003267e8f09ae25cb3c86703.mp4?t=1793273903\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRANCHING OUT<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you turn more and more zombies into mincemeat, explore the vast skill tree to optimize the killing!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/extras\/7dbd1cc99bbc298cfdf517fb0146c5cd.poster.avif?t=1793273903\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/extras\/7dbd1cc99bbc298cfdf517fb0146c5cd.webm?t=1793273903\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/extras\/7dbd1cc99bbc298cfdf517fb0146c5cd.mp4?t=1793273903\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LOCK AND LOAD<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kit your grunts out with the best toys you can get your hands on — after all, zombies are nice enough to deliver the loot right to your doorstep!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/extras\/95ad50f628e6bf2afd4734cfd8c0f226.poster.avif?t=1793273903\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/extras\/95ad50f628e6bf2afd4734cfd8c0f226.webm?t=1793273903\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/extras\/95ad50f628e6bf2afd4734cfd8c0f226.mp4?t=1793273903\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EMBRACE THE YUCK<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies are known to evolve, but evolution is boring and takes too long. Why not have your mad scientist speed it up a little? With predictably gross results, of course!<\/p>","short_description":"ShredDead is a short and relaxing incremental zombie-shredding game focused on progression with no lose conditions. Defeat endless waves, collect loot, grow your skill tree and evolve the zombies.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/481c251d90942aa2a768de63a65dee1a508a91a7\/header.jpg?t=1793273903","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/fffe895f9ff83764fd437188ea0e7d93fe0d6848\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793273903","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704520\/fffe895f9ff83764fd437188ea0e7d93fe0d6848\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793273903","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:<\/strong> Windows 7 or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core 2 Duo 2.40 GHz \/ AMD Athlon 2.40 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 11 compatible video card<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS Big Sur 11 or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M1+ or Intel Core i5<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":[]}}}